docs {
  Fetch a single datatype (struct/enum) definition from a Move package.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.MovePackageService` · **Method:** `GetDatatype` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `package_id` (required string): the storage ID of the package.
  - `module_name` (required string): the module the datatype lives in.
  - `name` (required string): the datatype's name.

  Example fetches `0x2::coin::Coin`, which returns its abilities, type
  parameters, and fields (`id`, `balance`).

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com`.
}
